        "relation": "support",
        "quote": "司法部汇总FBI统计：2020年反黑人仇恨犯罪2871起，较2019年增49%；同时报告机构数减少452家。",
        "publication_date": "2023-04-04",
        "observation_end": "2020-12-31",
        "limitation": "单年激增且报告机构减少，不能单独证明长期升级趋势。"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "prior-8da7b20fdfeb0c4b7b84",
        "relation": "counter",
        "quote": "黑人贫困率1991年32.7%、2001年22.7%；2002起黑人单一种族口径，2010年27.4%、2022年17.1%、2024年18.4%。2024非西班牙裔白人单一种族贫困率7.6%。",
        "publication_date": "2025-09-09",
        "observation_end": "2024-12-31",
        "limitation": "贫困率显著下降说明状况有改善，但相对白人差距仍大，口径在2002年变化。"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "prior-cbbe3051e049c110efa1",
        "relation": "counter",
        "quote": "黑人25岁以上劳动力无高中文凭占比1992为18.2%、2018为6.4%；学士以上15.9%→31.2%。同群体总失业率10.9%→5.3%，2009—2011显著反弹（2010/2011为13.4%），并非逐年单调改善。",
        "publication_date": "2019-02-13",
        "observation_end": "2018-12-31",
        "limitation": "教育与就业长期改善，但存在周期性反弹，不能证明“根本方法”已找到或未找到。"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev-bcfe5063081c56f198d4823b",
        "relation": "support",
        "quote": "analysis of the latest, though partial Federal Bureau of Investigation hate crime data release, when overlaid with available data from excluded large jurisdictions, reveals hate crimes hit a record high in 2021 in the United States that previously went unreported.",
        "publication_date": null,
        "observation_end": "2021-12-31",
        "limitation": "来源未标日期且为部分数据叠加估计，2021记录高位不能代表持续升级。"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev-4e197378210b0328451fc881",
        "relation": "counter",
        "quote": "In total, there were 11,679 hate incidents reported to the FBI in 2024, marking the second highest year on record since the FBI began reporting data in 1991. Compared to 2023’s total of 12,498, at this time, 2024 represents a 10 percent decrease.",
        "publication_date": "2025-08-05",
        "observation_end": "2024-12-31",
        "limitation": "总仇恨事件而非仅反黑人，且报告系统持续更新，年度波动不宜过度解读。"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev-6d021ad2bcb4eb35612eef47",
        "relation": "counter",
        "quote": "Earnings increased for Black children at all parental income levels, reducing white- Black earnings gaps for children from low-income families by 30%.",
        "publication_date": "2024-07-15",
        "observation_end": "2024-07-15",
        "limitation": "代际流动性研究显示种族差距缩小，但属学术估计，不直接对应“根本方法”判定。"
      }
    ],
    "remaining_gap": "缺少1991—2024年反黑人仇恨犯罪经报告覆盖率调整后的连续可比序列，以及“根本改善”的可操作阈值，无法判定条件成立与终局结果。"
